### Our new dataset

Take a look at the cleaned dataset:

```{r}
summary(df_clean)
```

### Save data

When we’re done, we can save the cleaned dataset as a new CSV file. As you can see, we save the new dataset in the Data folder:

```{r}
write.csv(df_clean, file = "Data/df_clean.csv", row.names = FALSE)
```

